Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "[123,[456,[789]]]" into source.
Keep a shared cursor as 0.
Keep a shared rendered as empty text.
Keep a shared value as 0.

To done.
The piece is format whole number value as text.
Place piece into rendered.

To read.
The here is cursor.
If here is more than the last position of source, done, return.
The symbol is character here of source.
If symbol is not between "0" and "9", done, return.
The digit is the digit value of symbol.
Set value to value times 10 plus digit.
Add 1 to cursor.
Read.

To parse group.
Place "[" into rendered.
Add 1 to cursor.
Repeat while cursor is at most the last position of source.
The here is cursor.
The symbol is character here of source.
If symbol is "]", Place "]" into rendered, add 1 to cursor, return.
If symbol is ",", Place "," into rendered, add 1 to cursor.
If symbol is "[", parse group.
If symbol is "-", Place "-" into rendered, add 1 to cursor, set value to 0, read.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", set value to 0, read.

Parse group.
Show rendered.
